  intro X Pr R Ch sel S₀ mu cst s P hP hm hd f f' hf hr hf' hr' x y
  exact GlobalTheory.PenPsiInv.psiAt_one_inFr Ch sel mu cst s P hP hm hd f f' hf hr hf' hr' x y
